ght: 0.5 kg (1 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 160 gp / 580 gpHHonour\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  160  gp /  580  gp<abbr title=\"Honour mode only\" class=\"bg3wiki-damage-rider-source nomobile\">H</abbr><sup class=\"mobileonly\">Honour</sup></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">MAG_Martial_Exertion_Gloves</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_Martial_Exertion_Gloves\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_Martial_Exertion_Gloves\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">2c6da257-8ca8-4e7c-847d-3e03bb32f260</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:2c6da257-8ca8-4e7c-847d-3e03bb32f260\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:2c6da257-8ca8-4e7c-847d-3e03bb32f260\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>Stats</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">MAG_Martial_Exertion_Gloves</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_Martial_Exertion_Gloves+type:stat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_Martial_Exertion_Gloves+type:stat\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>File</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">ARM_Gloves_Leather_F</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"></span></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Special\">Special</span></h3>\n<p>The wearer of this item gains:\n\n</p>\n<dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Martial_Exertion\" title=\"Martial Exertion\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/ff/Martial_Exertion_Icon.webp/40px-Martial_Exertion_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/ff/Martial_Exertion_Icon.webp/60px-Martial_Exertion_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/ff/Martial_Exertion_Icon.webp/80px-Martial_Exertion_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Martial Exertion\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/ff/Martial_Exertion_Icon.webp/40px-Martial_Exertion_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/ff/Martial_Exertion_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Martial_Exertion\" title=\"Martial Exertion\">Martial Exertion</a> </dt>\n<dd>Push past your physical limits, taking <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-piercing\">6d6</span><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon-wrapper\" style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-width: 25px; height: 25px;\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Piercing\" title=\"Piercing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/25px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/38px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/50px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Piercing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/25px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span><span class=\"bg3wiki-after-icon\"></span></span></span><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-text\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/Piercing\" title=\"Piercing\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-piercing\">Piercing</span></a></span></span> damage to gain an additional attack per turn and to double your <a href=\"/wiki/Movement_Speed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Movement Speed\">movement speed</a>. (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Short rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Short_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Short rest\">Short rest</a>.)</dd>\n</dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>    \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Angleiron%27s_Cellar\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Angleiron's Cellar\">Angleiron's Cellar</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-241&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-1065</span>: Sold by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bumpnagel\" title=\"Bumpnagel\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/22/Portrait_Bumpnagel.png/25px-Portrait_Bumpnagel.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/22/Portrait_Bumpnagel.png/38px-Portrait_Bumpnagel.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/22/Portrait_Bumpnagel.png/50px-Portrait_Bumpnagel.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bumpnagel\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/22/Portrait_Bumpnagel.png/25px-Portrait_Bumpnagel.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/22/Portrait_Bumpnagel.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bumpnagel\" title=\"Bumpnagel\">Bumpnagel</a></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>The cellar is accessible via a cave entrance at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;30&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;29</span> or via a trapdoor in <a href=\"/wiki/Rivington_General\" title=\"Rivington General\">Rivington General</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 300px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 298px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Martial_exertion_gloves_dyed.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Dyed variations\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b4/Martial_exertion_gloves_dyed.png/447px-Martial_exertion_gloves_dyed.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b4/Martial_exertion_gloves_dyed.png/670px-Martial_exertion_gloves_dyed.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b4/Martial_exertion_gloves_dyed.png/893px-Martial_exertion_gloves_dyed.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dyed variations\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b4/Martial_exertion_gloves_dyed.png/447px-Martial_exertion_gloves_dyed.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"298\" height=\"400\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b4/Martial_exertion_gloves_dyed.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dye\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Dye\">Dyed</a> variations</div>\n\t\t</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195257\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.076 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.080 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2464/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 43868/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 13838/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1069/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.015/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1147967/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansi